'''Tristan Trevor James Thompson''' (born March 13, 1991) is a Canadian–American former professional [[basketball]] player. Thompson played one season of [[college basketball]] for the [[Texas Longhorns men's basketball|Texas Longhorns]] before being selected by the [[Cleveland Cavaliers]] as the fourth overall pick in the [[2011 NBA draft]]. He won an [[2016 NBA Finals|NBA championship]] with the Cavaliers in 2016 and has also played for the [[Boston Celtics]], [[Sacramento Kings]], [[Indiana Pacers]], [[Chicago Bulls]], and [[Los Angeles Lakers]].<ref>{{cite web|title=Tristan Thompson|url=http://www.nbadraft.net/players/tristan-thompson|website=NBADraft.net|access-date=November 6, 2012}}</ref> Thompson also represented [[Canada men's national basketball team|Canada]] in international competitions.

